      "writtenOn": "2018-10-22T17:11:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "-\u003e has precedence over !, so I think this condition really means: if (firmware version number is zero) then (read tcpc). I tested again, and the caching mechanism definitely still works. I could add another set of parentheses to make it clearer if you want?",
